@startuml
title B — durable timer, replay и failover
autonumber
participant "Workflow Worker 1" as W1
participant "Temporal Service\n+ persistence" as T
participant "Activity Workers" as A
database "Delivery Ledger" as DB
participant "Каналы / клиент" as P
participant "Workflow Worker 2" as W2
participant "Receipt API + Relay" as C
W1 -> T: schedule push Activity
T -> A: push Activity Task
A -> DB: reserve push; success guard
A -> P: send push
P --> A: принято, receipt нет
A -> DB: ACCEPTED
A -> T: Activity completed(started_at)
T -> W1: результат Activity
W1 -> T: timer deadline = started_at + 5 с (оставшееся время)
note over W1: Worker 1 остановлен
... наступает durable deadline ...
T -> T: timer fired записан в history
W2 -> T: poll Workflow Task
T --> W2: history для replay
W2 -> W2: восстановить процесс; завершённую Activity не повторять
W2 -> T: schedule SMS Activity
T -> A: SMS Activity Task
A -> DB: текущие настройки + success guard + reserve SMS
A -> P: send SMS(attempt_id)
P --> A: принято
A -> DB: SMS ACCEPTED
A -> T: Activity result
P -> C: SMS DLR
C -> DB: receipt + signal_outbox; COMMIT
C -> T: повторяемый Signal(receipt_id)
T -> W2: Workflow Task с подтверждением
W2 -> T: DELIVERED; завершить workflow
note over A,DB
Если Activity упала ПОСЛЕ HTTP до результата,
возможен повтор Activity: тот же attempt ID,
ledger/status query, без слепого нового SMS.
Replay сам по себе не даёт exactly-once API.
end note
@enduml
